        "key": "SubEv_C03_TreatmentGirl_12_005",
        "jp_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_SubEv_C03_TreatmentGirl_12:SubEv_C03_TreatmentGirl_12_005:17727927",
        "official_en_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_SubEv_C03_TreatmentGirl_12:SubEv_C03_TreatmentGirl_12_005:17727927",
        "jp_sha256": "f37397f6879ac5b8ee4579d4e4af1cbb682356e8fc2ce10a3e117251ff508a23",
        "official_en_sha256": "51eee80344b08a16f1c38c7584248ef4aacea285f1758ba547c6df36c1ba0ace"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "でも、心配はいりません。\r\nオルデリオンの水がきれいであれば、\r\nいつか完全によくなるはずです。",
        "official_en": "You need not worry, however. So long as Olderion’s water remains pure, you can and will recover in full.",
        "real_en": "But don't worry. As long as Olderion's water stays clean, you should be able to make a full recovery someday."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
