    {
      "record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_SubEv_C03_TreatmentGirl_12:SubEv_C03_TreatmentGirl_12_003:f157f9c6",
      "source": {
        "set": "set-02",
        "namespace": "ST_SubEv_C03_TreatmentGirl_12",
        "key": "SubEv_C03_TreatmentGirl_12_003",
        "jp_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_SubEv_C03_TreatmentGirl_12:SubEv_C03_TreatmentGirl_12_003:f157f9c6",
        "official_en_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_SubEv_C03_TreatmentGirl_12:SubEv_C03_TreatmentGirl_12_003:f157f9c6",
        "jp_sha256": "d52371c56d3c558ec7a05918aae5dc55d30c62ebc5b53fbc67840349da276035",
        "official_en_sha256": "db2593e608b749f0e2fae352d48ca6432ecc6714ccb39b090adaa8c27b1397db"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "サーラ、調子に乗って無理はしないように。\r\n一時的に悪くなっていた体調が元に戻っただけですから。",
        "official_en": "Sarah, take care not to push yourself. The worst of your ailments has been cured, but this does not mean you have returned to the height of your strength...",
        "real_en": "Sarah, don't overdo it just because you're feeling better. You've only recovered from that temporary setback."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
