        "official_en_sha256": "0706d7bccbca3fe8cb573ecbd70377b9689d1729615dbb260f5007f9754bec15"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "水がきれいであることで、\r\n魔物が近寄らないこと以外にも\r\n助かってる人たちは多いです。",
        "official_en": "Keeping the monsters at bay is not the only benefit the waters of Olderion offer to its people.",
        "real_en": "Clean water does more than keep monsters away. A lot of people depend on it."
      },
